title: Sophos Firewall: PoE
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/sophos
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
description:
 PoE ports of the appliance (sfosXGHardware, SFOS 22.0 and later): enabled
 ports, power draw per port against its limit, voltage and current. The total
 power draw is recorded as metric. Disabled ports are not an error. A port at
 its power limit is {WARN}.

discovery:
 One service is created if the device has PoE ports.
